    public static final String f15595k0 = "Build an HTML/Android WebView app that opens the native Android share sheet.\nThe user wants: [DESCRIBE YOUR APP IDEA HERE].\nUse the global `AndroidAPI` JavaScript bridge.\nAvailable methods:\n- `AndroidAPI.shareText(text)`\n- `AndroidAPI.shareFile(nameOrPath, mimeType)` — a bare name is resolved inside the app's own files dir (so `writeAppFile('a.txt', ...)` + `shareFile('a.txt', 'text/plain')` works); an absolute path is used as-is. For generated bytes prefer `shareFileFromBase64`.\n- `AndroidAPI.shareFileFromBase64(fileName, base64Data, mimeType)` — shares generated content and accepts a `data:` URL prefix.\nBoth fire `shareResult` with `{kind, success, error}`; listen with `window.onAndroidEvent = function(event, data) { ... };`.\nWrite clean, responsive HTML with inline CSS and a share button.\nReturn only the complete HTML file.";

